//
// SmolVLA verify gate on the experimental all-NPU path (`--npu-all`): vision,
// language backbone and action expert all run on the NPU, against the same
// unmodified lerobot CPU model and the same regression gate as
// run_npu2_verify.lit (cosine >= 0.99 AND normalized MSE <= 0.04).
//
// The action expert runs as two engine ELFs (prefix + step) that later jobs
// read each other's drains from, so this is also the check that host
// read-backs stay ordered behind the drains that write them. They are built
// here first rather than lazily, so a build failure reports as one.
//
// The nightly folds this into smolvla's verify status, as it does the other
// models' run_npu2_verify_* variants. Same features and dependencies as
// run_npu2_verify.lit; see there.
//
// REQUIRES: ryzen_ai_npu2, peano, lerobot, hfweights_lerobot_smolvla_base, hfweights_huggingfacetb_smolvlm2_500m_video_instruct
//
// RUN: mkdir -p test_peano_verify_all
// RUN: cd test_peano_verify_all
// RUN: make -f %S/Makefile compile-expert PEANO_INSTALL_DIR=%PEANO_INSTALL_DIR
// RUN: make -f %S/Makefile verify-all PEANO_INSTALL_DIR=%PEANO_INSTALL_DIR | FileCheck %s
// CHECK: [verify] PASS
